        }
      ],
      "match": {
        "venue": "Groupama Stadium, Lyon"
      }
    },
    "386": {
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Fin Smith passes fitness test to start as Itoje returns for Australia",
          "body": "Steve Borthwick has kept faith with the fly-half who was a doubt until late. Smith, who came off late in Northampton's defeat by Leicester on 24 October, has started England's past five Tests at 10 and is named in the run-on group. Itoje returns as captain, with Ben Curry making his Test return after an injury-hit 16 months. Greg Fisilau, uncapped, is on a forward-heavy bench."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "South Africa's Kolbe out injured; Hooker named on wing",
