      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Dupont and Ntamack reunite at half-back for first time since March 2025",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's preview of Saturday's Lyon fixture describes it as a 20-month hiatus since the pair last started together at half-back. Ntamack has been hit by numerous injuries, including a long-running kidney problem, while Dupont missed the whole of July with a calf issue. Matthieu Jalibert is out with a quadriceps problem. Dupont captains the side, and Sarugbymag notes that locks Emmanuel Meafou and Thibaud Flament are among the absentees."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England captain Itoje returns; Fin Smith starts at fly-half",
