    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Ross Vintcent on Italy bench as cousin Riley Norton dropped by Springboks",
          "body": "Ross Vintcent, the 24-year-old loose forward who qualifies for Italy through his maternal grandfather, had hoped to meet his second cousin in Saturday's Test in Turin, but Riley Norton was left out of Rassie Erasmus' match 23. Vintcent is named on the Azzurri bench. \"Unfortunately, he wasn't selected, but they love watching Italy and me just as much as they love watching the Boks,\" Vintcent told Reuters. Vintcent has faced the Springboks three times without a win."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England captain Itoje returns; Fin Smith starts at fly-half",
          "body": "South Africa's Kolbe out injured; Hooker named on wing. France set to reunite Dupont and Ntamack at half-back. Ireland's Jack Crowley sidelined; Sam Prendergast starts at fly-half."
