    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Momentum swings",
          "heading": "Jack Dempsey names momentum as Scotland's first fix before All Blacks test",
          "body": "Jack Dempsey will win his 36th Scotland cap against the All Blacks on Saturday. Scotland have had three near misses in a row under Gregor Townsend, and Dempsey puts the problem bluntly: \"We can be the best team in the world for 20 minutes and we can be the worst team in the world for 20 minutes.\" His second point is messaging, which he says captain Sione Tuipulotu has been preaching, staying stronger together for longer. Habits will change, he says, if the moments keep stacking."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England captain Itoje returns; Fin Smith starts at fly-half",
