          "kicker": "Bath signing",
          "heading": "Bath sign Argentine prop Marcos Camerlinckx from Pampas XV",
          "body": "Camerlinckx, 22, a former Argentina Under-20 international, has joined Bath. Director of rugby Johann van Graan told the club website: \"We are looking forward to seeing how Marcos will develop his game over the next period of time and I am sure he will fit into our group very well.\" The tight-head arrives having won this year's Super Rugby Americas Championship with Pampas XV, and he played for an Argentina XV against the United States in August. Bath have not disclosed the length of his deal."
