          "heading": "Kingsley Jones, former Wales international, joins Japan camp this week before Cardiff",
          "body": "Japan have a familiar face in the Cardiff build-up: Kingsley Jones, a former Wales international who left his role as Canada head coach last year, has spent four days in the camp. Eddie Jones says Kingsley Jones is \"in camp, just watching what we're doing and feeding back on how we can improve.\" He was also involved in the camp before Japan's July 2025 win over Wales in Kitakyushu, and Japan are still seeking a first win on Welsh soil."
